# --- Vercel + Supabase deploy ---
# Injected automatically by the Vercel Supabase integration; DATABASE_URL is only
# needed locally as a manual override (e.g. the direct/non-pooled URL for `migrate`).
# DATABASE_URL=
# POSTGRES_URL=
